    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a> with the given <a href=\"Metric.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Metric</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个带有给定<a href=\"Metric.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的接口\"><code>Metric</code></a>的新的<a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类\"><code>Distance</code></a>。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>metric</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>metric</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>value</code> - distance value.",
      "translation": "<code>value</code> - 距离值。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Adds the given <a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a> to the current one and forces the result to be in a given <a href=\"Metric.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Metric</code></a>.",
      "translation": "将给定的<a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a>添加到当前距离，并强制结果以指定的<a href=\"Metric.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Metric</code></a>为单位。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"../domain/Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> by creating minimum and maximum <a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a> from the given values.",
      "translation": "根据给定值创建最小和最大<a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a>，从而生成一个新的<a href=\"../domain/Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a href=\"../domain/Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> between the given <a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a>.",
      "translation": "在指定的<a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a>之间创建一个<a href=\"../domain/Range.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a> with a neutral metric.",
      "translation": "创建一个具有中性度量标准的新的<a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类\"><code>Distance</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the normalized value regarding the underlying <a href=\"Metric.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Metric</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回关于底层<a href=\"Metric.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的接口\"><code>Metric</code></a>的归一化值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> representation of the unit the distance is in.",
      "translation": "返回距离所在单位的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 表示形式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a> with a neutral metric. This means the provided value needs to be in normalized form.",
      "translation": "创建一个具有中性度量标准的新的<a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.geo 中的类\"><code>Distance</code></a>。这意味着提供的值需要处于标准化形式。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
