    {
      "source": "Returns a new <a href=\"Distance.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Distance</code></a> in the given <a href=\"Metric.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>Metric</code></a>. This means that the returned instance will have the\nsame normalized value as the original instance.",
